  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TOCH: Integrated Community Resilience Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project is implemented in Jur River and Wau (WBeGS) and Tonj North and Gogrial East (WS) counties, and focuses on peacebuilding, GBV prevention, and economic empowerment. It strengthens community-led conflict resolution, supports survivors of GBV through protection services, and enhances livelihoods by promoting skills development and financial inclusion for women and girls. It engages local leaders, peace committees, and women&#x2019;s groups.</narrative>
  </description>
